# 共用規則：不含 "/" 的規則（如 node_modules）會套用到所有子目錄；含 "/" 的規則會錨定在根目錄，需寫成 **/ 開頭

# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

# Dependencies
node_modules
**/.yarn/*
!**/.yarn/patches
!**/.yarn/plugins
!**/.yarn/releases
.pnp.*

# Build output
dist
dist-ssr
build
coverage
*.tsbuildinfo

# Env
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.local

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# ---- api (Google Apps Script / clasp) ----
# clasp 登入憑證，絕不能進版控
.clasprc.json
